Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.69,0:00:05.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行 由佳吏 我們還沒有...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還沒有什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.81,0:00:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒事的我們終究是要結婚的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:13.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.72,0:00:31.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈也把舌頭伸出來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我怎麼會做這種夢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.66,0:00:50.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼會做這麼逼真的夢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:57.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我都還沒有接過吻呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:11.97,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真っ赤な線を描いたちっぽけな心の話
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.98,0:01:18.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らの未来はどこに向かって光るの
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:25.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,続きの線を描いた　色づいてしまう度にまぶしい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:30.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,そんな心のリズムを繋ぎだす
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:38.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしいかなしいかなしい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.96,0:01:44.96,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,うれしいうれしいうれしいうれしい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:51.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,２つの感情に揺さぶられては
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.35,0:01:59.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,まだ見ぬ指先を照らし出してくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.41,0:02:06.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,このまま嘘でもいいから夢泳がせて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:12.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,かなしいかなしい今を探してく
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:19.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,僕らは見えない未来を信じてる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:25.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,だから悲しい悲しい今を探しては光った
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.47,0:02:26.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,引つかた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,深吻十秒就能互相交換8000萬細菌
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:36.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有助於提高免疫力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,8000萬?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.77,0:02:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接吻魚會為了爭奪異性而以接吻進行競爭
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:47.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不會吧 怎麼會有這麼敗壞風氣的魚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.96,0:02:45.76,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真田同學
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.97,0:02:48.97,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真田同學
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:53.26,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真田莉莉奈同學
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.60,0:02:58.04,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,絛蟲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:51.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雖然是想調查下接吻的意義的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.66,0:02:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這不就沒完沒了了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是看看那些解夢的書比較好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.25,0:03:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,終於聽見了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.51,0:03:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.13,0:03:10.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.05,0:03:12.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只見過名字而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是第一次見到你本人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.26,0:03:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我以前倒是見過你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.06,0:03:19.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,絛蟲還是很有名的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:22.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 不該叫你蟲子的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.44,0:03:23.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我該怎麼叫你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真田丸 親親莉莉 小莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.28,0:03:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些暱稱是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.90,0:03:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且為什麼你非要給我取個暱稱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.78,0:03:36.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為我想和你做朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.41,0:03:41.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美作老師
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.50,0:03:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,學校裡有這個人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就直樹 笨蛋直樹 傻瓜直樹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.09,0:03:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我才不認識什麼紅卷紙藍卷紙黃卷紙的直樹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.18,0:03:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好厲害 你說繞口令很厲害呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.05,0:03:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是第一次說出來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.27,0:04:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 直樹 直樹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,直樹老師
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.31,0:04:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒錯 就是六年前負責你的實習醫生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.91,0:04:10.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是他妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.03,0:04:12.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.93,0:04:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.57,0:04:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.16,0:04:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥說你總是見不到父母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,治療也很困難
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你肯定也很難過
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而你卻從不哭泣 是個堅強的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:30.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,當我知道小時候聽說的這位公主就是你的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.34,0:04:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就更想瞭解你了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:37.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 和我交朋友吧 真田莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你有這份心我很高興
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.27,0:04:49.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 我從來沒有和你說過話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:57.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就沒辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.45,0:04:59.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.08,0:05:02.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和你聊了幾句就能看出
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.04,0:05:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你亳無保留 又正直又有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:10.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是能和你成為朋友一定會很開心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:14.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈總是一生氣就把什麼都說出來
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,反而讓我很輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.43,0:05:22.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要做朋友的話 具體要做些什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.23,0:05:27.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我雖然有一個朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是和你一點也不像
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你能教我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.24,0:05:39.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,當然了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.74,0:05:42.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過只有一個朋友 真是太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.00,0:05:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其實還有一個 我也不知道能不能算是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 大概 有一點重要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:05:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,露營之後
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.18,0:06:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得我和高崎同學之間的距離應該縮短了點
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪 那傢伙總是翹課
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他會不會留級啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.39,0:06:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過 仁阪成績很好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:10.26,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美咲 再見啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.40,0:06:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,之前他有說過是算好了時間才翹課的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.40,0:06:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 我現在有點忙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.37,0:06:21.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,高崎同學在躲著我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.12,0:06:26.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,找到你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.46,0:06:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竹田 根島 你們倆快回去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.29,0:06:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼 老師
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你們倆今天要去參加厚勞省的講習會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上面通知參加那個講習會的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:41.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天早上下課後要立刻放你們回去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.31,0:06:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那竹田也收到了講習會的通知嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.23,0:06:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 是父母給我申請的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.81,0:06:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我家也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.36,0:06:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:55.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你現在過來幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:57.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天的課都過半了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:06:58.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.07,0:07:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼 你們要回家嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 好像要去參加什麼特別講習會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.99,0:07:08.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,告訴你也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.87,0:07:14.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們的工作中有一頂叫做特別講會
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.59,0:07:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個講習會是厚勞省舉辦的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,仁阪知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:25.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 我知道得也不多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:26.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.52,0:07:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:31.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是別老翹課比較好哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這裡就是厚生勞動省啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.54,0:07:56.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她是和我一個中學的五十嵐同學吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.09,0:08:00.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,五十嵐同學也是來聽講習的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.01,0:08:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小根
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:11.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.81,0:08:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你 你好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.69,0:08:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,初次見面 我是阿大的政府通知對像 吉木遙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:22.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在隔壁的音樂大學上學
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:25.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是根島
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.45,0:08:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就是小根嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.78,0:08:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他一直有跟我說起你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:30.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,從小學就和阿大是同學了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竹田根本配不上她
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:37.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 你的對象呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.79,0:08:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她還沒來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.63,0:08:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的嗎 真想看看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.67,0:08:45.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿大真是的 人家又不是熊貓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.97,0:08:46.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,說的也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.93,0:08:49.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這麼說來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,竹田就要和這個人結婚成為夫婦了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.81,0:08:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是不可思議啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:09:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不只是竹田 這個會場裡的人們都是這樣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.78,0:09:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,從旁人的角度來看我和莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.03,0:09:06.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是否也是同樣的想法呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.20,0:09:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.99,0:09:10.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我遲到了 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.41,0:09:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,稍微花了點時間準備了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.79,0:09:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等了很久了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.09,0:09:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你等了多少分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.63,0:09:23.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我給你賠罪好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的頭髮怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.68,0:09:27.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你把頭髮放下來了 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:31.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是朋友教我的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.85,0:09:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很奇怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒有 很可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.02,0:09:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很適合你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.73,0:09:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 今天在車站看見了這個
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.95,0:09:47.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得你可能會喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是鎧甲武士陶俑
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.66,0:09:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是這個 就是這個我一直沒能收集到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.83,0:09:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好厲害啊 莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.20,0:09:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真好啊 真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:09:58.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就是打算送給你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.79,0:10:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:04.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這麼貴重的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.17,0:10:08.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝你 謝謝你 莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好棒 全身都在顫抖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.43,0:10:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道了 你冷靜點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.51,0:10:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 作為回禮
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:16.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,給你這個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.23,0:10:19.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我覺得莉莉奈你應該會喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.60,0:10:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且還是貓
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.15,0:10:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,謝謝 我會好保管它的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是般配呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.41,0:10:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府通知真厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.99,0:10:37.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能感覺倒你們互相喜歡呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.87,0:10:41.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,講習會即將開始
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:44.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請各位進入會場
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.71,0:10:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿大 我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,小根也快來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,果然從旁人的角度看來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也覺得我們是要結婚的夫婦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:10:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣的誤解真是太過分了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.39,0:11:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為是政府通知的對象就說這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.07,0:11:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,說到底也不過是先入為主
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我從沒想過要和你接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就算在夢裡也沒想過
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:14.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,夢裡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.78,0:11:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:19.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總之 我和那些敗壞風氣的魚類是不同的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.71,0:11:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且你也不是那種人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.35,0:11:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.63,0:11:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.30,0:11:31.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈對我根本沒有那種想法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.18,0:11:34.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這也沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.97,0:11:38.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈一定也想和自己喜歡的人在一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:43.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府通知有時也真是殘酷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.19,0:11:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.36,0:11:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我說怎麼這麼吵鬧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.78,0:11:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原來今天有那個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:54.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,畢竟就要放暑假了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每學期大概都是這個時間段吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.04,0:12:01.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.62,0:12:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不覺得這是種惡趣味嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.71,0:12:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不會啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.67,0:12:09.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被政府通知選中的兩人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,總有一天必須面對這件事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.34,0:12:15.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是在幫助他們 僅此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.72,0:12:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也差不多該開始了 我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.19,0:12:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被選中的兩人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:35.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你又是怎樣看待政府通知的 根島由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.01,0:12:41.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.85,0:12:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天來場的各位都是已經接到政府通知的情侶
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.81,0:12:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且大部分的人的父母也都是通過政府通知結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.77,0:12:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即為所謂的「姻緣世代」
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.90,0:12:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在超少子化對策基本法的作用下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:13:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,現在的出生率也基本保持在2.1左右
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.50,0:13:02.41,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒想到這個演講會這麼正經 還有點無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.49,0:13:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家都明白小孩並不是送子鳥送來的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而是父母通過性行為 也就是做愛而誕生的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.51,0:13:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那麼現在我要開始分發一些東西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請往後傳遞
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.47,0:13:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是什麼 傳單嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.85,0:13:31.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今天我們就是關於進行講習和練習
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.15,0:13:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏 發了什麼東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:36.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.70,0:13:41.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.07,0:13:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.83,0:13:45.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼現在要發這種東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.25,0:13:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且講習和練習又是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:51.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那麼大家收到政府通知也有段時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.67,0:13:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家和自己的對象相處的怎麼樣了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.55,0:13:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好嗎 相處還愉快嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.13,0:13:58.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,開心嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.93,0:14:02.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 還算不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:04.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是嗎 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.10,0:14:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.60,0:14:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏覺得怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.81,0:14:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一眼看過去 大家相處的好像都還不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.81,0:14:13.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就安心了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:17.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,與對像一起聊天相處覺得很愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.57,0:14:19.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是一件美好的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做愛也是同樣的道理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.12,0:14:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是人類在學會語言之前就一直在進行的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:29.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最為原始的一種交流方式
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就是做愛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.75,0:14:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不需要做什麼奇怪的架子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.09,0:14:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感覺快樂好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.84,0:14:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不只是會感到快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.17,0:14:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,做愛還有很多好處
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.91,0:14:46.49,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,定期進行性行為 男性患前列腺癌的幾率也會下降
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:49.33,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也能促進女性荷爾蒙的分泌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在國家的演講會上要講這種事嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.56,0:14:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真不愧是少子化對策
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.64,0:14:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,此外還能分泌一種讓人感到幸福的叫催產素的荷爾蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,緩解壓力 提高免疫力 有很多好處
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.65,0:15:01.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.53,0:15:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈原來也對這種內容感興趣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因為好學嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.24,0:15:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那麼 雖然說了這麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.75,0:15:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,人類進行性行為的最重要的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還是因為它所來的快感
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家突然抬起頭來了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.51,0:15:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這正是和你們年齡相符的正常反應
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.09,0:15:24.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我認為是件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.76,0:15:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是當然 的和相愛的人做愛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.01,0:15:32.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是一件非常美妙的事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.52,0:15:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有興趣也是當然的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.44,0:15:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.31,0:15:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那才是最大的動機 也太不純潔了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.28,0:15:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和類人猿有什麼差別
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.78,0:15:47.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話雖如此 也不能隨便就做做看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,特別是女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對自己沒有自信或是有難以言語的自卑
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.79,0:15:55.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這種女生還是大有人在的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.33,0:15:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是 沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,政府通知是建立在最新的科學理論上進行的選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:08.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只要不弄錯順序一定可以得到很棒的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其原因就是你們就如灰姑娘和玻璃鞋一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.85,0:16:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是被選中的佳偶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.73,0:16:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,灰姑娘和
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.19,0:16:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,玻璃鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.53,0:16:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,該怎麼說呢 她總結的真好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.28,0:16:29.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那麼 接下來請大家看一段影像資料
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.41,0:16:40.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我原來以為這場演講會只是厚勞動省主辦的保健課
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到現在為止
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:48.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.10,0:16:53.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,感覺好露骨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.35,0:16:56.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.77,0:16:59.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.86,0:17:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個 這個是真正的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.78,0:17:08.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,根島同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.28,0:17:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不妙 想點別的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.41,0:17:13.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因數分解 怎麼算來著
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快想辦法 16歲的根島由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.58,0:17:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:26.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈肯定沒有看過這種東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.01,0:17:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.27,0:17:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是 沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.62,0:17:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.04,0:17:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎 怎麼回事 這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:01.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對了 其他人在做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.88,0:18:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是竹田吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.09,0:18:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,騙人的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.13,0:18:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 這是真的 就在我面前發生的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:12.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.89,0:18:19.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,到底哪邊才是正確的選擇呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.56,0:18:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你一直喜歡的女生 和政府通知的對象
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.86,0:18:30.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果一邊是真正的愛 另一邊是謊言
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那到底是自己選擇的人還是政府通知的對象呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.79,0:18:37.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你怎麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這是在說高崎同學和莉莉奈的事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.33,0:18:47.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不過不管你怎麼想 都快要到下決定的時候了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.97,0:18:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一個房間 會有人監視著你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.85,0:18:58.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那個 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我胡說的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.41,0:19:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 辛苦大家了 你們覺得如何呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.99,0:19:20.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看來很累了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.62,0:19:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那麼 關於接下來的練習
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:26.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,請各位與自己的同伴在房間裡共度一晚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在房間裡過一晚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:33.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個 難道是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.89,0:19:40.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下來會按順序點名
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.39,0:19:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被點到名字的人請出來跟工作人員走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.98,0:19:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個 不做的話會有懲罰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.57,0:19:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.69,0:19:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,聽說朋友的姐姐沒做被人發現 就被叫去談話了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:19:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還傳到學校 影響了成績 鬧得一團亂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:02.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,話說別人怎麼知道他們沒做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.00,0:20:03.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又不是強制性的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.71,0:20:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我們就慢慢來吧 慢慢來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.46,0:20:11.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你嘴上這麼說 今晚你肯定還是會做的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.59,0:20:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.27,0:20:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我還以為是像會議室一樣的房間
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還以為又要聽人演講了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:40.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.16,0:20:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下一個房間 會有人監視著你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.79,0:20:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,監視 是指有攝像頭 還是竊聽器呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,沒有椅子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.17,0:20:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這個不做的話會有懲罰吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:00.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,懲罰是指什麼事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.85,0:21:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且被叫去談話是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.97,0:21:08.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏你以前應該看過那種東西吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.48,0:21:10.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.61,0:21:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 看過
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.36,0:21:17.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.45,0:21:21.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我還是第一次看 嚇我一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.20,0:21:24.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就只想著自己的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.79,0:21:29.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,這件事不只關係到 我還有莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.83,0:21:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉莉奈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.98,0:21:33.69,TopHorizontalCenter,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.96,0:21:35.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,為了她
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以做些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.09,0:21:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:47.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,由佳吏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.37,0:22:26.15,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,さっきの言葉はまだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.15,0:22:28.68,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say I want to say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.68,0:22:30.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,言えないままでしまってる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.76,0:22:33.04,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I always lie
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.04,0:22:35.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,星の瞬きほど早く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:37.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,願い事するひまも無く
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.76,0:22:39.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短い夏が終わってく
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.90,0:22:42.72,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I can't say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.72,0:22:45.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Heart beat sound
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.61,0:22:51.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,気づかないでいてね高鳴る鼓動
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.61,0:22:55.57,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,Can't keep it to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.57,0:22:58.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然にこぼれたはにかむ顔が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:04.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,隠せないメッセージ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.75,0:23:06.58,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,I know why I love you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:09.04,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,未来を重ねた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.04,0:23:13.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,二人の温もりが ここに残ってる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.74,0:23:15.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ありふれた日々に
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:18.34,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,はじまりのキスを
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.34,0:23:33.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,ひとりの夜は 君の夢を見てた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.42,0:23:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,主持人的胸部真的好大
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.30,0:23:39.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是啊 的確很大
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.84,0:23:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,下集 無言的謊言
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.21,0:23:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,用那大胸來填滿我空虛的心靈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:11.97,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下等待的長線 這是心中小小的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.98,0:01:18.31,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們的未來 到底會走向何方呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:25.28,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}畫下連續的長線 接下來的旅途必定也耀眼奪目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:30.74,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣 連接上心的旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:38.25,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷 悲傷 悲傷和悲傷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.96,0:01:44.96,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}快樂 快樂 快樂和快樂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.76,0:01:51.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}把兩份感傷的心疊放在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.35,0:01:59.09,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}看不清的未來裡誰才是該出場的配角
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.41,0:02:06.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}就這樣下去 即使是謊言也讓我把這美夢做完吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:12.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 現在就去尋找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.88,0:02:19.79,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}我們相信著看不見的未來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:25.47,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}悲傷地 悲傷地 去尋找著
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.47,0:02:26.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,{\an8}現在就去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.37,0:22:26.15,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,剛才想說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.68,0:22:30.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,還沒能說出口
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.04,0:22:35.33,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時間轉瞬即逝
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:37.76,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,無暇許下心願
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.76,0:22:39.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,短暫夏日就此結束
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.61,0:22:51.61,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,別讓他發現 心聲難以克制
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.57,0:22:58.42,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,自然流露的靦腆表情
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:04.75,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,掩藏不住心意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:09.04,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兩人的溫度
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.04,0:23:13.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,歷經歲月 停留在此
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.74,0:23:15.74,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在平淡的日子裡
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:18.34,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,時常回想起我們第一次的吻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.34,0:23:33.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孤獨的夜裡 在夢中與你相會
